     "start": 793,
     "end": 801
    },
    {
     "start": 801,
     "end": 809
    }
   ],
   "content": "清淨恭敬天母之，任何智者極虔讃，"
  },
  {
   "reference": "2-2",
   "id": "0DvzdBVl3Mu093vXeTMeU",
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
