    },
    {
     "start": 825,
     "end": 833
    },
    {
     "start": 833,
     "end": 841
    }
   ],
   "content": "晨昏醒起皆憶持，憶念即離諸怖畏，一切罪業悉滅除，一切惡趣盡摧壞。"
  },
  {
   "reference": "2-3",
   "id": "GRaSvC7uAZ2mFhqo0ynyh",
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "start": 841,
     "end": 849
