    },
    {
     "start": 857,
     "end": 865
    },
    {
     "start": 865,
     "end": 873
    }
   ],
   "content": "並得七千萬勝眾，迅速賜予諸灌頂，獲得從此益增盛，趣入究竟佛果位。"
  },
  {
   "reference": "2-4",
   "id": "cIblaow0BspDXZ8UH4q4N",
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "start": 873,
     "end": 881
