     "end": 897
    },
    {
     "start": 897,
     "end": 905
    }
   ],
   "content": "他方之毒極猛烈，頑固不動或竄行，縱使服食或飲用，憶念即得盡消除。"
  },
  {
   "reference": "2-5",
   "id": "qahxKheieuMLhWy8ufJKY",
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
     "start": 905,
     "end": 913
