    },
    {
     "start": 921,
     "end": 929
    }
   ],
   "content": "邪魔瘟疫與毒害，所起諸苦悉斷除，其餘有情亦如是。"
  },
  {
   "reference": "2-6",
   "id": "B3VMRW5HWs4naK0U8Pnbi",
   "type": "verse",
   "lines": [
    {
